  "content": "\n\n# Lux V1\n\n<center>\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://patreon.com/techthedev\"><img src=\"https://intellitonic.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/become_a_patron_button@2x.png\" alt=\"Support Me On Patreon\" width=\"300\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<center>\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://discord.gg/eZ6GpXQXGC\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/853294489636831242?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&label=Discord&labelColor=ffffff&color=5865f2&link=https%3A%2F%2Fdiscord.gg%2FuBhFaBG\" style=\"height: 50px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\"></a>\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://twitter.com/TheRealTechDev\"><img alt=\"X (formerly Twitter) Follow\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/TheRealTechDev?style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=black&labelColor=white&color=%23101013\"></a>\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/lux-shaders\"><img alt=\"CurseForge Downloads\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/863609?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&color=%23f16436&labelColor=ffffff\"></a>\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/shader/lux-v1\"><img alt=\"Modrinth Downloads\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/DiGQENDV?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&color=%2316a869&labelColor=ffffff\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n![Imgur](https://imgur.com/p2kIQGi.jpg)\n\nLux 是一款高畫質的《我的世界》Java 版著色器包，基於 [Capt Tatsu 的 BSL 著色器](https://bitslablab.com \"Takes you to the BSL Website\")。\n\n預設情況下，Lux 主要針對中階至高階使用者設計，但提供了廣泛的設定選項，讓您能完全打造屬於自己的光影體驗。在力求跨不同硬體與軟體規格高度相容、兼具美觀與遊玩友善度的同時，Lux 也融入了許多實驗性且少見的功能。它正持續頻繁更新，雖然在遊戲中仍屬新秀，但已採用更先進的技術來呈現優美的視覺效果，絕對是一款不容錯過的著色器包。\n\n## 錯誤回報\n\n如果您遇到任何問題，請使用 [GitHub 問題追蹤器](https://github.com/TechDevOnGitHub/Lux-Shader/issues)。",
